WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.070
Narrator: Half-time at Vomitory 12.

2
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.300
Narrator: Majed is watching the replays.

3
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.800
Narrator: Noura is watching the crowd.

4
00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:14.720
Narrator: She sees the flow stop at the top of the stairs.

5
00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:17.980
Noura: This way please, more toilets at Gate 14.

6
00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:21.760
Narrator: She reports, directs fans towards space and keeps the landing clear.

7
00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:23.950
Narrator: Support arrives.

8
00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:26.720
Narrator: Nobody gets hurt.

